  click G_RUN href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L350" "run(modelContext:now:), called from ContentView on launch and every foreground, HomeTabView.sendMessage after a capture, TasksTabView.createSessionItem. Exams no longer expand here; only the commitment phase writes. New rows trigger NudgeCopyGenerator.noteShift." _blank
  click G_PROPOSE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlanProposalSweep.swift#L308" "runIfNeeded, called from ContentView, HomeTabView, TasksTabView (editor saves, Add your own), CalendarTabView. Always applyUserPlanOverrides first. Then, with the message box on and under the daily call cap, asks Claude whether open anchored items are worth a plan and stores proposals; it writes no task rows itself." _blank
  click G_ACCEPT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlanProposalSweep.swift#L527" "accept: one source prep row per session with setPlanDay(session day), no deadline, linkedEventId = parent id; skips tombstoned days and existing (day, title) pairs. Called by answerPlanProposal (message box Yes) and requestPlan (chat Yes)." _blank
  click U_DELETE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L1972" "deleteTask (swipe) and the editor's onDelete in TasksTabView and CalendarTabView: recordDeletionIfGenerated, then delete, save, widget reload, arbiter." _blank
  click G_PHASE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L389" "commitmentPhase. Step 1: every open parent with commitmentShapeRaw whose numbers are known and whose start-day question is not outstanding today becomes a NudgeCommitment (start day from commitmentStartDate or the viability default) and the parent is deleted. Step 2: per commitment, the missing day stamps inside the horizon (7 days; split work once, rate and quantity topped up) get a daily: title = sessionTitle or the goal name, dueDate = 23:59 of the day, source commitment, linkedEventId = commitment id, estimatedMinutes = dailyMinutes, targetCount for quantity. Tombstoned days are skipped. Step 3: applyQuantityCarry." _blank
  click G_CARRY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L659" "applyQuantityCarry: each quantity daily with a dueDate before today is consumed in date order (its shortfall becomes NudgeCommitment.carryUnits, capped) and deleted; today's daily gets carriedCount stamped." _blank
  click G_OVERRIDE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlanProposalSweep.swift#L216" "applyUserPlanOverrides: for a parent with app-made prep sessions, if one of the user's own open tasks reads as their plan for it (title match), the sessions are deleted and the decision marked userOwned." _blank
  click G_COMMITROW href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeCommitment.swift" "The durable parent after expansion: title, sessionTitle, shape, endDate, startDate, totalMinutes, dailyMinutes, dailyCount, carryUnits, sourceTaskId." _blank
  click D_MISSED href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlacementRollover.swift#L147" "sweepMissedSessions on launch and foreground: an open prep row whose day has passed is tombstoned, logged as missed, deleted." _blank
  click G_TOMB href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L721" "recordDeletionIfGenerated: only for source prep or commitment rows with a linkedEventId; the day stamp is dueDate ?? intendedDate. One tombstone per (parent, day); the message-box note is shown once per parent." _blank
  click K_TOMB href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/PrepTombstone.swift" "examEventId (parent id), examTitle, dayStamp, noteShownAt. Read by commitmentPhase and accept so a deleted day is never recreated." _blank
  click S_UNPLANNED href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L151" "A commitment daily: owed at 23:59 of its day, no plan day, so belongs(to:) puts it in Today on that day by its anchor; the planner places it only on its own day; the dueSoon builder skips it." _blank
  click S_DAY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L121" "A study session: planned for its day, never due; the planner places it only on that day; not counted as a slip by the rollover." _blank
  click S_GONE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L477" "Deleted rows: the expanded commitment parent, consumed past quantity dailies, app sessions outranked by the user's own plan, missed prep sessions, and user deletions." _blank
